{"id":"ba057dd8edbd10e3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTyShiftProof.md","title":"FTyShiftProof","display":"FTyShiftProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FTyShiftProof","parameters":["c","k","t","u","z1823"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FTyShiftProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>c</span><span>k</span><span>t</span><span>u</span><span>z1823</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 语法。有序参数：<code>c</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>、<code>z1823</code>。</p>\n<p>类型指标提升；进入全称类型时 cutoff+1。：非空有限见证列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FTyShiftProof c k t u z1823)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1826\n  (exists z1827\n    (and\n      (@ Seq z1823 z1826)\n      (and\n        (@ Last z1823 z1827)\n        (and\n          (exists z1849\n            (and (exists z1850 (and (@ Pair t u z1850) (@ Pair k z1850 z1849))) (@ Pair c z1849 z1827)))\n          (forall z1824\n            (implies\n              (in z1824 z1826)\n              (exists z1825 (and (@ App z1823 z1824 z1825) (@ FTyShiftRow z1823 z1824 z1825))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b01b2c5a0d33d82e\" href=\"?note=b01b2c5a0d33d82e\" title=\"ZFC_FTyShiftRow\">FTyShiftRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FTyShiftProof c k t u z1823)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShiftRow|FTyShiftRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTyShiftRow","status":"resolved","id":"b01b2c5a0d33d82e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShiftRow|FTyShiftRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Last","status":"resolved","id":"d72dedf3d7200b4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShiftRow|FTyShiftRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTyShiftRow|FTyShiftRow]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embe